  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Runemaster Decoder lets Elemental Burst and Runeblade trigger the Weapon Engraving (#1320)",
  "contract": [
    "Decoder 706523 (Runic talent, passive): 'Your Elemental Burst and Runeblade now have a $h% chance to instantly",
    "trigger your Weapon Engravings.' $h is the record's ProcChance 20. Effects 1 and 2 are aura 42 naming the",
    "'Firebrand Conditioned Proc' 681241 and 'Decoder Trigger' 681500/681528 helpers that fan out to every",
    "engraving's effect spell (Firebrand 653210, Earth 653272, Ice 653217, Arcane 653263, Water 653261); effect 0 is",
    "aura 354 naming 707152, whose 8 sec 'next Thaumaturgy, Runic Brand or Surging Slash' tooltip belongs to an older",
    "design. Spell.dbc gives 706523 ProcFlags 0, so SpellMgr generated no proc entry and nothing ever happened.",
    "Elemental Burst ranks carry family 38 mask2 0x20000 (magic), Runeblade ranks mask2 0x40000 (melee).",
    "Expected: with Ice Engraving 653266 active (the equip aura of enchant 1004, which has no proc entry of its",
    "own), about one in five Runeblade and Elemental Burst hits casts one Weapon Engraving: Ice strike 653217 on the",
    "target; without Decoder none does. 40 Runeblades and 35 Elemental Bursts bound the chance: no strike at all has",
    "a probability of 0.8^40 and 0.8^35 (under 0.05% together), and the upper bounds reject a 100% trigger.",
    "QA Test +10000 HP/MP 10040 at 20 stacks supplies the mana for 75 casts."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 300000,
